{"id":"97fc176afb39ca42","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-zfc-tree11-common-initial-segment.md","title":"ZFC Tree11 Common Initial Segment","display":"df-zfc-tree11-common-initial-segment — ZFC Tree11 Common Initial Segment","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-tree11-common-initial-segment","aliases":["58-df-zfc-tree11-common-initial-segment"],"display":"df-zfc-tree11-common-initial-segment — ZFC Tree11 Common Initial Segment","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-ordinal2-ordinal-indexed-sequence]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-tree11-common-initial-segment"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-tree11-common-initial-segment</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-tree11-common-initial-segment — ZFC Tree11 Common Initial Segment"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"44c6814fd2d8eda0\" href=\"?note=44c6814fd2d8eda0\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-zfc-ordinal2-ordinal-indexed-sequence\">../batch06/58-df-zfc-ordinal2-ordinal-indexed-sequence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c,s,t,\\alpha\\in V\">\\(c,s,t,\\alpha\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2OrdinalIndexedSequence}_S(s,\\beta,A)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2OrdinalIndexedSequence}_S(s,\\beta,A)\\)</span> is the ordinal-sequence predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"44c6814fd2d8eda0\" href=\"?note=44c6814fd2d8eda0\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-zfc-ordinal2-ordinal-indexed-sequence\">../batch06/58-df-zfc-ordinal2-ordinal-indexed-sequence</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}_S\\)</span> is the ordinal predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree11CommonInitialSegment}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree11CommonInitialSegment}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree11\\text{-}common\\text{-}initial\\text{-}segment}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree11CommonInitialSegment}_S(c,s,t,\\alpha)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\beta,\\gamma,A,B\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2OrdinalIndexedSequence}_S(s,\\beta,A)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2OrdinalIndexedSequence}_S(t,\\gamma,B)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}_S(\\alpha)\n\\land\n\\alpha\\subseteq\\beta\n\\land\n\\alpha\\subseteq\\gamma\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{10em}\\land\nc=s\\upharpoonright\\alpha\n\\land\nc=t\\upharpoonright\\alpha\n\\land\n\\forall\\delta\\;\n\\Bigl(\n(\\mathrm{Ordinal}_S(\\delta)\\land\\alpha\\in\\delta\\land\\delta\\subseteq\\beta\\land\\delta\\subseteq\\gamma)\n\\to\ns\\upharpoonright\\delta\\neq t\\upharpoonright\\delta\n\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree11\\text{-}common\\text{-}initial\\text{-}segment}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree11CommonInitialSegment}_S(c,s,t,\\alpha)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\beta,\\gamma,A,B\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2OrdinalIndexedSequence}_S(s,\\beta,A)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2OrdinalIndexedSequence}_S(t,\\gamma,B)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}_S(\\alpha)\n\\land\n\\alpha\\subseteq\\beta\n\\land\n\\alpha\\subseteq\\gamma\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{10em}\\land\nc=s\\upharpoonright\\alpha\n\\land\nc=t\\upharpoonright\\alpha\n\\land\n\\forall\\delta\\;\n\\Bigl(\n(\\mathrm{Ordinal}_S(\\delta)\\land\\alpha\\in\\delta\\land\\delta\\subseteq\\beta\\land\\delta\\subseteq\\gamma)\n\\to\ns\\upharpoonright\\delta\\neq t\\upharpoonright\\delta\n\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The sequence domains and the candidate length are explicitly ordinal-typed; maximality is tested against every strictly longer common domain.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-zfc-ordinal2-ordinal-indexed-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"44c6814fd2d8eda0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-ordinal2-ordinal-indexed-sequence]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-zfc-ordinal2-ordinal-indexed-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"44c6814fd2d8eda0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2OrdinalIndexedSequence}_S(s,\\beta,A)$ is the ordinal-sequence predicate from [[../batch06/58-df-zfc-ordinal2-ordinal-indexed-sequence]].","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ordinal}_S$ is the ordinal predicate from [[../batch17/58-df-ordinal]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"c,s,t,\\alpha\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2OrdinalIndexedSequence}_S(s,\\beta,A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree11CommonInitialSegment}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree11\\text{-}common\\text{-}initial\\text{-}segment}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree11CommonInitialSegment}_S(c,s,t,\\alpha)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\beta,\\gamma,A,B\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2OrdinalIndexedSequence}_S(s,\\beta,A)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2OrdinalIndexedSequence}_S(t,\\gamma,B)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}_S(\\alpha)\n\\land\n\\alpha\\subseteq\\beta\n\\land\n\\alpha\\subseteq\\gamma\\\\\n&\\hspace{10em}\\land\nc=s\\upharpoonright\\alpha\n\\land\nc=t\\upharpoonright\\alpha\n\\land\n\\forall\\delta\\;\n\\Bigl(\n(\\mathrm{Ordinal}_S(\\delta)\\land\\alpha\\in\\delta\\land\\delta\\subseteq\\beta\\land\\delta\\subseteq\\gamma)\n\\to\ns\\upharpoonright\\delta\\neq t\\upharpoonright\\delta\n\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1696,"backlinks":[{"id":"eb94cd034539276b","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTree11CommonInitialSegment}_S\\subseteq V^4$ (see [[../batch14/58-df-zfc-tree11-common-initial-segment.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3787","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-tree11-common-initial-segment.md|58-df-zfc-tree11-common-initial-segment]]（batch14）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","44c6814fd